  /* ══ D440 THE DEVICE LIST GETS THE APP'S LIGHT (owner, 2026-10-23) ═══
     "Add the glowing effects to the home screen of the entire app where you
     select your device ... make that look more complete ... and have a link
     to my website." The rest of the app has D435/D436 (zs-fixes.css); this
     page loads none of the app on purpose (see the top of this block), so
     the same light is declared here, in its own words:

     1. THE WASH (.amb, static): a vertical fade from a lifted, faintly cool
        top to a deeper bottom, a soft light from above, a fixed grain tile
        so the long dark gradient never bands.
     2. TWO LIGHTS (.amb-l): oversized soft radial gradients, no filter;
